<title>INDIA: CRICKET-PAKISTAN BEAT INDIA BY 35 RUNS.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-PAKISTAN BEAT INDIA BY 35 RUNS.</headline>
<dateline>MADRAS, India 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistan beat India by 35</p>
<p>runs in the four-nation Independence Cup on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Scores: Pakistan 327-5 (Saeed Anwar 194). India 292 in 49.2</p>
<p>(Rahul Dravid 107; A. Javed 5-61).</p>
<p>Pakistan will meet Sri Lanka in the finals.</p>
</text>
